  "notes": "Warm off-white (#faf8f4) paper background with no cards — table rows separated by hairline rules only. Serif wordmark and H1 give a boutique/editorial feel atop a plain utilitarian admin. All controls (buttons, selects, search) use 6px-radius thin outlines; status pills are fully rounded (radius 9999), neutral outlined for PAID/UNFULFILLED and pale-green tinted for FULFILLED. Links (order #, public ID, emails) all in bright #2563eb blue, the dominant color on the page. Sidebar active state = 2px dark left rule. Sidebar separated from main by a single vertical hairline. Hidden checkbox 'Toggle admin sections' suggests sidebar collapses on narrow screens (not verified). Sorting via header links with no visible indicator."
